[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8102.47, "timestamp": "02:15:02", "text": "那我不介意这么做。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8106.51, "timestamp": "02:15:06", "text": "在不做太多改变的情况下，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8112.47, "timestamp": "02:15:12", "text": "知道。所以，你喜欢它吗？我喜欢它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8117.589, "timestamp": "02:15:17", "text": "你也帮了我很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8120.589, "timestamp": "02:15:20", "text": "了解事物运作方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8123.669, "timestamp": "02:15:23", "text": "一切。我很高兴我问了你这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8126.39, "timestamp": "02:15:26", "text": "那天，我对这一切都感到非常陌生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8134.709, "timestamp": "02:15:34", "text": "但是，这个模型也很棒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8136.31, "timestamp": "02:15:36", "text": "但如果你只是，我也会看着你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8137.91, "timestamp": "02:15:37", "text": "就像去一个非常垃圾的包装盒里一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8147.75, "timestamp": "02:15:47", "text": "溪流。我想要……不，问题是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8151.109, "timestamp": "02:15:51", "text": "我，我本来应该，呃，至少"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8154.95, "timestamp": "02:15:54", "text": "在 Jathan 期间预览艺术作品，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8157.51, "timestamp": "02:15:57", "text": "但随后出现了一些复杂情况。"}]